<title>SINGAPORE: Nepal issues tender to buy July 21-31 kerosene.</title>
<headline>Nepal issues tender to buy July 21-31 kerosene.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Nepal Oil Corp (NOC) has issued a tender to buy 30,000 tonnes of superior kerosene for July 21-31 delivery to the Indian east coast, industry sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on June 24 and offers are valid to June 26.</p>
<p>In its last tender, NOC bought one cargo for July 1-10 delivery at $199.37 per tonne cost-and-freight Indian east coast from Dutch trader Vitol, they said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65- 870 3093)</p>
